        {
            "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
            "body": "The bulk of the PR is concerned with modifying `get_known _filetypes` to ingest any user-defined filetypes, and should be a drop in replacement. `get_known_filetypes` is only used in the health check (which I'm assuming isn't performance critical!), but I'd like to know what your specific concerns are.",
